"en": "That there's kinda far...\nHow 'bout 20,000 yen t'cover it!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_adv_shop_sp|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11284,
"en": "T'thank ya fer always usin' my taxi,\nI wanna give ya this ride fer free!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_adv_shop_sp|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11285,
"en": "Hello there, Kiryu-san!\nWelcome to the Nyan Nyan Café!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_adv_shop_sp|#",
"max": null
},
{
