"en": "I'm sure they'll be happy to see you!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_adv_shop_sp|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11288,
"en": "Our feline friends were overjoyed!\nNice choice, Kiryu-san!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_adv_shop_sp|#",
"max": null
},
{
