"id": 11474,
"en": "A guy I thought of as just a friend actually\nconfessed his feelings for me...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11475,
"en": "When I turned him down, he got all mad, and he\nasked, \"Then why were you leading me on!?\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11476,
"en": "Sorry to hear that happened.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11477,
"en": "I went to an all-girls school, so maybe I don't\nknow how much distance to put between a guy.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11478,
"en": "Erina, do you approach your male and female\nfriends the same way?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11479,
"en": "Let's see... I've never given it much thought,\nand I'll go see movies with them and stuff.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11480,
"en": "Kiryu-san... How do men see women like that?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11481,
"en": "They might misinterpret that. If you go out\nalone with them, it could get their hopes up.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11482,
"en": "So, that is how it works...\nI just wanted to hang out, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11483,
"en": "Men fall into that mindset too easily. A date\nlike that almost always leads to the wrong idea.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11484,
"en": "Next time, try inviting someone else to tag\nalong. That should clear up any confusion.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11485,
"en": "I see.\nI'll try to be more careful next time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11486,
"en": "Yeah, that'd be best for the both of you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11487,
"en": "I'm glad I asked you, Kiryu-san!\nYou're so reliable. That's awesome. <symbol=heart_with_outline>",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11488,
"en": "(I get it now... I can see how guys could get\nthe wrong idea from this...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11489,
"en": "I think treating everyone as equals is one of\nyour strengths, Erina. You don't need to change.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11490,
"en": "Y-You think so?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_sora|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11491,
"en": "Yeah. Men only grow by overcoming misunderstandings\nand failures. It's not your job to worry about it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11492,
"en": "That's pretty deep, Kiryu-san.\nDoes that hit close to home for you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11493,
"en": "Sure. Misunderstandings, being too late...\nA lot of different experiences.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11494,
"en": "But I don't look back on any of it with regret.\nThey're what made me who I am today.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11495,
"en": "Kiryu-san, you're a pretty cool guy.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11496,
"en": "If a guy like you says so, then...\nI guess I'll stay how I am. <symbol=heart_with_outline>",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11497,
"en": "They're the best.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|# + talk",
"max": 63
},
{
"id": 11498,
"en": "Huh? The... best?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11499,
"en": "Yeah.\nMind games like that are the very heart of love.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11500,
"en": "Besides, a woman with a seductive edge is more\nattractive than the cold shoulder for sure.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11501,
"en": "Mind games, huh? I hadn't thought about\nit like that. Is that how men see it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11502,
"en": "Yeah. It's the guy's fault for misunderstanding,\nbut you've got to be confident about that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11503,
"en": "You're right! I wanted to hear a man's opinion,\nso that's really refreshing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11504,
"en": "I'm glad I asked you, Kiryu-san!\nYou're such a reliable guy. <symbol=heart_with_outline>",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11505,
"en": "Kiryu-san, Kiryu-san!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11506,
"en": "Hm? What's up? You seem happy.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11507,
"en": "Guess what? I finally made a friend!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11508,
"en": "Erina... You...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11509,
"en": "Oh, please don't look at me with those sad eyes!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11510,
"en": "I worked hard, and I finally achieved my goal\nof making a girl friend!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 11511,
"en": "You were working to make sure nobody called you\nfake, conniving, and cold-blooded, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_caba_erina|#",
"max": null
}
]